SUMMARY:The Neon Room: Matt Banwart
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Originally from Iowa\, now based out of Austin\, Texas\, Matt B
 anwart is best known for hosting and judging the hit online show Roast Batt
 le Chicago alongside guests like Jeff Ross\, Dusty Slay\, Robert Kelly\, an
 d Kam Patterson. He is the host of the new live show You Laugh You Leave Li
 ve alongside YouTuber Jimmy Here\, where he's had the privilege of hosting 
 live comedy shows with some of the biggest content creators online.\n\nMatt
  has headlined clubs across the country and has worked and written for some
  of the biggest names in comedy!\n\nHis debut stand-up comedy album\, "Town
  Kid\," landed at #1 on Amazon and iTunes comedy charts. Matt has generated
  millions of views online across YouTube\, TikTok\, and Instagram\, and rec
 ently performed at Chicago's 312 Comedy Festival and Madison Comedy Week.\n
